    "body": "There are some challenges with this layout-wise. The pattern we're mainly interested in enabling is `<element accesskey=...>text node children</element>` which is doable, but it's unclear if not working when there's element children makes it sufficiently usable to be standardized.\r\n\r\nCurious to hear what people think and what other markup patterns ought to be considered.",
